\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \lang2057\langfe1033\langfenp1033\insrsid6513979\charrsid983060 Earlier research conducted by Googl
e with researchers from New York University and University of California, San Diego also demonstrated the effectiveness of additional authentication challenges. In their study, SMS based challenges blocked 100% of automated bot attacks, 96% of bulk phishi
ng attacks and 76% of targeted attacks in the investigated dataset. Device based prompts performed better against targeted attacks, blocking 90% of them }{\field{\*\fldinst {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \lang2057\langfe1033\langfenp1033\insrsid983060 
